    "name": "ReqRes - QA Portfolio",
    "description": "**Functional and negative REST API test suite developed for Quality Assurance (QA) validation.**\n\n**Test Scope:**\n\n- **CRUD Operations:** Validation of paginated data retrieval (`GET`), record creation (`POST`), data updates (`PUT`), and deletion (`DELETE`).\n    \n- **Authentication & Negative Scenarios:** Verification of login workflows and expected error handling (`400 Bad Request` when required fields are omitted).\n    \n- **Automated Assertions:** Post-response JavaScript scripts to validate HTTP status codes (`200`, `201`, `204`, `400`), JSON payload structures, and dynamic environment variable extraction (`user_id`).\n    \n\nEndFragment",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57988667",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/57988667-d72a3ce5-a36c-4a53-90fa-ba9fed9b4d1d?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "List users",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status é 200 OK\", () => {\r\n    pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r\n});\r\npm.test(\"Página devolvida é a 2\", () => {\r\n    const json = pm.response.json();\r\n    pm.expect(json.page).to.eql(2);\r\n});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users?page=2",
          "host": [
